WEBVTT

00:00.014 --> 00:01.675
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.675 --> 00:03.344
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION AND
SHAMEFUL ACTS ARE NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:03.344 --> 00:04.970
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:10.351 --> 00:13.979
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

00:13.979 --> 00:16.982
Right now is always
the best of the season

00:17.191 --> 00:20.653
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

00:20.736 --> 00:24.198
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

00:24.198 --> 00:27.368
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

00:27.535 --> 00:29.620
Ever Endless

00:30.829 --> 00:32.498
Ever Endless

00:34.250 --> 00:35.793
Ever Endless

00:37.670 --> 00:39.046
Ever Endless

00:39.713 --> 00:44.510
Mon-Tues-Weds-Thurs-Fri,
my life knows no variety

00:44.510 --> 00:45.928
Ever Endless

00:46.345 --> 00:51.141
Sat-Sun, wake up in the afternoon
with only my smartphone to surf

00:51.141 --> 00:52.726
Ever Endless

00:52.726 --> 00:54.144
All my limbs' been giving in

00:54.144 --> 00:55.980
Kalbi's a burden
like my lumber spine

00:55.980 --> 00:57.565
Doing family
service with irises dim

00:57.565 --> 00:59.191
But you know that
I'll go all the way

00:59.608 --> 01:02.778
Glitter, shimmer,
the light's shining

01:03.028 --> 01:06.615
Let's give it one more chance

01:06.615 --> 01:10.077
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

01:10.286 --> 01:13.080
Right now is always
the best of the season

01:13.289 --> 01:16.917
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

01:16.917 --> 01:19.920
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

01:20.129 --> 01:22.298
Youth is when you never...

01:22.298 --> 01:23.799
stop chasing your own values

01:23.799 --> 01:25.467
Our youth's eternal

01:25.467 --> 01:27.052
the color never fades with age

01:27.052 --> 01:28.929
Youth is when you keep...

01:28.929 --> 01:30.472
getting lost along the way

01:30.472 --> 01:33.976
Youth is Forever

01:34.977 --> 01:38.439
OUMI WOMEN'S COLLEGE

01:38.439 --> 01:39.106
FRANKFURTERS - SO DELICIOUS

01:39.106 --> 01:41.650
To prepare for the
women's college festival,

01:41.650 --> 01:44.236
I researched every
method for picking up girls.

01:45.529 --> 01:47.114
PICKING UP GIRLS AT A WOMEN'S
COLLEGE According to the website,

01:47.573 --> 01:50.951
an outfit that blends in with
everyone else is the safest bet.

01:50.951 --> 01:53.245
You must observe and
assess the situation.

01:53.996 --> 01:56.081
It's true that if you
dress too flashy...

01:56.081 --> 01:59.585
...or make your clear intention to
pick up girls, they'll be on guard.

01:59.960 --> 02:04.006
Basically, you should wear clothes
that blend into your surroundings.

02:04.506 --> 02:05.299
But...

02:06.175 --> 02:08.719
dressing like this
is definitely wrong.

02:08.969 --> 02:12.515
Iori-chan, Kou-chan,
the coffee is ready.

02:12.515 --> 02:13.807
Understood.

02:14.016 --> 02:15.100
CAKIE CAFE

02:15.100 --> 02:16.977
"Cakie Cafe?"

02:16.977 --> 02:20.356
Why does that sound like an evil
chant that crushes men's hearts?

02:20.356 --> 02:22.358
Is this like the
ninth circle of hell?

02:22.358 --> 02:25.653
Umm, the girls who are
running the shop with us...

02:27.404 --> 02:29.657
got all fired up when
they saw this picture.

02:29.657 --> 02:31.116
Aren't they disgusted?

02:31.450 --> 02:33.869
They're not just your
friends in name, I see.

02:33.869 --> 02:36.705
I can't understand why anyone
would want a face like that.

02:36.705 --> 02:37.706
That's true.

02:37.706 --> 02:39.833
You're one to talk.

02:39.833 --> 02:43.128
But looking like that, you shouldn't
be able to get being hit on, right?

02:44.213 --> 02:45.339
Did something happen?

02:45.589 --> 02:47.258
Yeah, on our way here.

02:48.634 --> 02:50.594
Then will you help
me out too, Chisa?

02:50.594 --> 02:51.887
It's good against flirting.

02:51.887 --> 02:53.931
That's unrelated to this.

02:53.931 --> 02:56.016
Come on, don't be like that.

02:57.351 --> 02:58.310
For real.

02:58.811 --> 02:59.520
I'm begging you.

02:59.520 --> 03:03.858
Chisa-chan would not get
hit on at Oumi Festival, right?

03:03.858 --> 03:05.943
Why do you have
to be so desperate?

03:05.943 --> 03:07.528
Why, you ask?

03:07.987 --> 03:09.655
Don't make me say it.

03:09.864 --> 03:10.698
Why?

03:10.698 --> 03:14.827
It's because I want to see
your ugly face, of course.

03:14.827 --> 03:16.203
Absolutely not.

03:16.203 --> 03:17.288
Please, just do it.

03:17.288 --> 03:18.080
No way.

03:18.080 --> 03:19.957
- It's like being in a haunted house.
- No!

03:19.957 --> 03:22.626
- You could make some new friends here.
- Rejected.

03:22.626 --> 03:25.337
Maybe you could
invite them to go diving!

03:27.089 --> 03:27.756
I...

03:28.257 --> 03:29.717
I will give it a think.

03:29.717 --> 03:30.426
That's easy.

03:30.426 --> 03:31.468
Way too easy.

03:31.468 --> 03:32.428
Chisa...

03:32.845 --> 03:35.181
But it'll be embarrassing
doing it alone!

03:35.181 --> 03:36.098
Alone?

03:36.098 --> 03:37.600
Cakey's doing it too.

03:37.600 --> 03:38.767
Well, yeah.

03:38.767 --> 03:40.060
That's not what I mean.

03:40.311 --> 03:41.687
Then what do you mean?

03:41.687 --> 03:44.273
Are you going to make
this guy put on makeup too?

03:44.273 --> 03:44.940
Huh?

03:46.567 --> 03:48.527
No matter what you say...

03:48.527 --> 03:50.487
this joke has gone too far.

03:51.280 --> 03:52.114
Chisa?

03:52.531 --> 03:54.158
Hey, Iori.

03:54.366 --> 03:55.367
Yes?

03:55.618 --> 03:58.454
You dressed up as
Azusa-san last time, didn't you?

04:02.666 --> 04:05.336
Then I'll also put down
Iori to help out, ok?

04:05.336 --> 04:06.170
Okay.

04:06.170 --> 04:07.630
It's not okay!

04:08.047 --> 04:09.673
It's only natural.

04:09.673 --> 04:10.508
Why is that?

04:10.508 --> 04:13.219
You are both qualified
and experienced.

04:15.638 --> 04:18.390
Cakey, this guy can
make a natural girly voice.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.558
Mix- something.

04:19.558 --> 04:20.434
Hired.

04:20.559 --> 04:22.394
HIRED Kitahara!!

04:22.478 --> 04:25.231
It's lonely being left out
by your friends, right?

04:25.231 --> 04:28.025
Shut it! I have an
important mission!

04:28.025 --> 04:29.026
Mission?

04:29.318 --> 04:31.987
He's planning to grab a
seat at a voice actor's concert.

04:32.279 --> 04:34.490
There's over 8 hours
before it starts though.

04:34.490 --> 04:35.574
Your point?

04:35.574 --> 04:36.909
To have a proposal.

04:36.909 --> 04:37.743
A proposal?

04:37.743 --> 04:38.577
Like I care.

04:38.577 --> 04:41.580
There's nothing more
important than today's concert.

04:41.914 --> 04:44.333
My friend is involved
in running the show.

04:44.333 --> 04:47.127
If you help out, I'll let you
meet that voice actress.

04:47.127 --> 04:48.754
Transform! Kyun! Kyun!

04:48.754 --> 04:50.130
What a quick change of heart.

04:50.130 --> 04:53.717
So, you'll all help
out at our shop, right?

04:54.176 --> 04:55.344
Leave it to us!

04:55.344 --> 04:57.263
No way!

04:57.388 --> 05:03.060
CAKIE CAFE

05:06.313 --> 05:09.066
I just wanted to
make Chisa look ugly.

05:09.066 --> 05:11.193
Just shut up and
work, Iori-chan.

05:11.193 --> 05:13.195
But Chisa surely takes her time.

05:13.195 --> 05:15.865
Well, girls need a lot
of time to get ready.

05:16.407 --> 05:20.911
Hmph! Girls need a lot of
time to get ready, big brother.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.705
As if you'd know.

05:22.705 --> 05:24.206
Sorry to keep you waiting.

05:31.547 --> 05:33.674
Come on, don't be shy.

05:34.717 --> 05:37.595
Don't look at me like that.

05:38.345 --> 05:40.055
A magnificent
masterpiece, Cakey.

05:40.055 --> 05:42.766
Only a master would kill
her natural beauty like that.

05:42.766 --> 05:44.059
If I do say so myself.

05:44.059 --> 05:46.103
I should've just declined.

05:46.520 --> 05:48.689
Oh, who're those girls?

05:48.689 --> 05:49.773
A cakey presence!

05:50.024 --> 05:51.609
CAKEY Are they your friends?

05:51.609 --> 05:53.944
CAKEY Yeah, they
said they'd help out.

05:53.944 --> 05:55.821
CAKEY Really? Thanks.

05:57.656 --> 05:59.867
Nice to meet you.
I'm Kanako Iida.

06:00.075 --> 06:01.327
I'm Keiko Suzuki.

06:01.327 --> 06:03.037
I'm Kiyoko Kamio.

06:03.037 --> 06:05.080
Um... I'm Chisa Kotegawa.

06:05.289 --> 06:06.373
What's wrong?

06:06.373 --> 06:08.083
No, it's just...

06:08.083 --> 06:10.336
it's not our first time meeting.

06:13.088 --> 06:16.675
Eh? Are these two
Iori-kun and Kouhei-kun?

06:17.843 --> 06:18.969
Amazing.

06:19.929 --> 06:23.015
Stop, Kikko, you're
laughing too much.

06:24.016 --> 06:25.017
You know them?

06:25.017 --> 06:26.227
We've met before.

06:26.227 --> 06:27.978
It's a disgusting memory.

06:27.978 --> 06:30.981
Well, sorry about that time.

06:31.148 --> 06:33.067
Hey, this bitch
just took a picture.

06:33.067 --> 06:35.528
Really? Delete
it, please delete it.

06:35.819 --> 06:37.696
I can finally come clean now.

06:37.696 --> 06:42.159
It was Aina who asked
us to ruin that mixer.

06:43.369 --> 06:44.537
Cakey, you bitch!?

06:44.537 --> 06:45.871
What does that mean?

06:47.248 --> 06:49.667
T-There's no deeper
meaning behind it.

06:49.667 --> 06:51.335
I wonder why?

06:51.335 --> 06:54.296
Maybe you didn't want
someone to be stolen away?

06:54.964 --> 06:58.425
Jeez! If you say another
word, I'll get mad for real!

06:58.551 --> 07:01.804
Then are you Iori-kun's
rumored girlfriend?

07:02.930 --> 07:04.306
Thanks for helping out.

07:04.557 --> 07:07.017
Sorry for making you
wear this weird outfit.

07:07.017 --> 07:09.228
Aina really doesn't
know how to hold back.

07:09.228 --> 07:10.187
Ah, um...

07:10.187 --> 07:11.689
Can I call you Chisa?

07:11.689 --> 07:12.648
Ah, okay.

07:12.648 --> 07:14.149
You can call me Keeko.

07:14.149 --> 07:15.150
And call me Kikko.

07:15.568 --> 07:16.527
Is this...

07:17.027 --> 07:19.947
the women's college festival
I've always dreamed of?

07:20.865 --> 07:22.324
COLLEGE GIRL

07:23.200 --> 07:24.660
COLLEGE GIRL

07:25.619 --> 07:27.538
COLLEGE GUY

07:27.538 --> 07:30.541
It's so different
from what I imagined.

07:31.208 --> 07:32.835
Why are you getting depressed?

07:32.835 --> 07:34.378
I should be asking you that.

07:34.378 --> 07:35.421
What do you mean?

07:36.005 --> 07:38.507
Why are we the only
ones with normal makeup?

07:38.507 --> 07:40.676
We should all have thick makeup!

07:41.427 --> 07:42.428
That's true.

07:42.636 --> 07:44.221
Because if we did that...

07:44.221 --> 07:46.473
all the trouble would
fall on you guys.

07:46.473 --> 07:49.018
Who could stand that
makeup, too cakey!

07:49.018 --> 07:50.936
If we're gonna hit
anyone, it'll be them.

07:50.936 --> 07:52.021
Shudder!

07:52.021 --> 07:53.314
This is terrifying!

07:53.314 --> 07:55.691
If I was mentally weak, I
would already killed myself.

07:55.691 --> 07:57.735
CAKIE CAFE

07:57.776 --> 08:00.279
Why does a shop like
this even have customers?

08:00.446 --> 08:02.656
Is this what they
call morbid curiosity?

08:02.656 --> 08:03.699
How rude.

08:03.908 --> 08:06.410
But we're having fun.

08:06.410 --> 08:09.830
My older sister came by
and she is having a blast too.

08:09.830 --> 08:12.166
Is it really okay for both
sisters to be like this?

08:12.166 --> 08:14.710
Their parents would
faint if they saw this.

08:14.877 --> 08:18.214
Dressed like this, I definitely
wouldn't want anyone I know seeing...

08:18.214 --> 08:20.674
Yoohoo, so cakey!

08:20.674 --> 08:22.426
Ah, Azusa-san.

08:22.760 --> 08:24.470
I'll be intruding for a bit.

08:24.637 --> 08:26.055
Please, come in.

08:26.263 --> 08:27.556
Welcome.

08:27.890 --> 08:30.601
Oh, could that be Chii-chan?

08:30.601 --> 08:32.061
Ah, yes.

08:32.728 --> 08:34.939
I'm impressed you
could tell it was Chisa.

08:34.939 --> 08:36.857
THUMP THUMP Of
course, can I take a picture?

08:36.857 --> 08:38.359
THUMP THUMP Absolutely not.

08:42.154 --> 08:46.116
Thump! Thump! Thump! Thump!

08:46.116 --> 08:46.700
Heave ho!

08:46.700 --> 08:48.869
Ah!

08:49.119 --> 08:50.538
What are you doing?

08:50.538 --> 08:53.040
It's really Iori. So cute.

08:53.040 --> 08:55.417
Who flips a skirt
to confirm like that?!

08:55.584 --> 08:57.127
What the heck is he saying?

08:57.127 --> 08:59.129
He's usually fine
with being naked.

08:59.547 --> 09:01.674
That means the one
over there is Kouhei.

09:01.674 --> 09:03.801
Exactly!

09:04.218 --> 09:06.679
You're right, I'm only
myself when I'm naked.

09:06.679 --> 09:07.221
Let's strip.

09:07.221 --> 09:08.180
Don't.

09:08.180 --> 09:10.307
Our shop will close
so keep them on.

09:10.599 --> 09:12.184
Huh? Azusa?

09:12.184 --> 09:12.810
Ah.

09:13.018 --> 09:16.021
CAKEY

09:16.397 --> 09:18.524
Oh, could it be Maya?

09:18.524 --> 09:19.817
That's right.

09:19.817 --> 09:21.569
- Long time no see, how are you?
- In that state...

09:21.569 --> 09:22.987
- Same as always.
- how did she recognize her?

09:22.987 --> 09:26.031
- It's Azusa-san, after all.
- I'm swamped every day.

09:26.031 --> 09:28.075
Huh, what's my big sister doing?

09:29.660 --> 09:32.288
You know Kanako's older sister?

09:32.288 --> 09:33.414
That's right.

09:33.414 --> 09:35.374
We haven't seen
each other in a while.

09:35.374 --> 09:37.668
You could call it a
physical relationship.

09:37.668 --> 09:40.838
Azusa, that sounds so shady.

09:40.880 --> 09:43.757
If other people hear
you, they'll misunderstand.

09:43.757 --> 09:44.717
"Misunderstand"?

09:44.717 --> 09:45.801
I'm sure she meant it.

09:46.427 --> 09:49.096
By the way, Iori, are
you busy right now?

09:49.221 --> 09:50.598
Unfortunately.

09:50.598 --> 09:52.224
Oh, is that so?

09:52.224 --> 09:54.310
I actually need some help.

09:54.310 --> 09:55.269
Help?

09:55.269 --> 09:59.565
Yeah, my friend's in charge
of the performance committee.

09:59.565 --> 10:03.444
And the setup fell behind, so
the concert might get cut short...

10:04.236 --> 10:05.738
Call me your loyal bitch.

10:06.155 --> 10:08.908
I'll go change into
something easier to move in.

10:09.950 --> 10:10.910
Is that okay?

10:10.910 --> 10:12.244
It's too late to say it.

10:12.244 --> 10:14.330
If we stop him, he'll
get mad for real.

10:15.039 --> 10:17.166
Then I'll go over
and help too...

10:17.166 --> 10:18.250
You aren't allowed to.

10:18.250 --> 10:19.126
Rejected.

10:19.126 --> 10:19.960
Why?

10:21.587 --> 10:22.838
Sorry to for the wait.

10:23.130 --> 10:24.840
Easier to move in?

10:25.007 --> 10:26.967
Can you get any
work done like that?

10:27.301 --> 10:30.471
My outfit today will help
me unleash my true power.

10:30.471 --> 10:32.056
I-Is that so?

10:32.556 --> 10:35.184
If you insist, then
do as you please.

10:35.184 --> 10:36.727
As expected of Kouhei.

10:36.727 --> 10:38.103
Then I'll borrow him.

10:38.103 --> 10:39.688
Let's hurry.

10:40.147 --> 10:41.941
What an outrageous outfit.

10:42.358 --> 10:44.401
He's always like that.

10:44.401 --> 10:45.361
Always like that?

10:45.778 --> 10:48.906
Yeah. As you can
see, he's really a creep.

10:50.366 --> 10:51.450
I see.

10:51.784 --> 10:55.871
I told him straight up that
he was an creep as well.

10:57.164 --> 10:58.624
How awful.

10:59.375 --> 11:01.418
Huh? Did you say something?

11:01.794 --> 11:03.128
It's nothing.

11:03.128 --> 11:04.296
Is that so?

11:04.797 --> 11:09.009
Maybe everyone's interests
just seem like that to other people.

11:09.969 --> 11:10.761
That might be it.

11:10.970 --> 11:13.097
But that's exactly
what make me think...

11:13.097 --> 11:13.848
Huh?

11:16.100 --> 11:17.268
He's really...

11:17.309 --> 11:17.977
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

11:21.981 --> 11:24.817
CAKIE CAFE

11:25.150 --> 11:28.195
After Kouhei left,
it gets even busier.

11:28.195 --> 11:30.531
If you think that,
then work faster.

11:30.531 --> 11:31.574
Yes, ma'am.

11:32.616 --> 11:35.369
Welcome...

11:35.828 --> 11:36.871
A table for four.

11:36.871 --> 11:38.581
It's really hot today.

11:38.581 --> 11:40.207
My throat is parched.

11:40.499 --> 11:43.377
No way. Why are
those bastards here?

11:43.377 --> 11:45.588
At least, don't pick
me to serve them.

11:45.588 --> 11:47.464
Miss waitress, is
there a problem?

11:49.341 --> 11:52.178
If you're not feeling well,
I can lend you my back.

11:52.178 --> 11:54.805
Hey hey, hitting on her already.

11:54.805 --> 11:56.265
How shameless.

11:56.265 --> 11:58.309
You can just ignore this bunch.

11:59.727 --> 12:00.936
Could these guys...

12:00.936 --> 12:02.730
Is there something on my face?

12:02.730 --> 12:03.939
No, nothing.

12:03.939 --> 12:05.399
You're just as ugly as ever.

12:05.399 --> 12:08.569
Miss, instead of that
ugly guy, look at me.

12:09.028 --> 12:11.197
Don't they recognize me?

12:11.780 --> 12:14.617
Me, ugly? What a cruel joke.

12:14.617 --> 12:16.535
It's just an honest opinion.

12:16.535 --> 12:18.120
Go look in the
restroom's mirror.

12:18.120 --> 12:19.580
Take a look at reality as well.

12:20.539 --> 12:22.208
Let me show you your seats.

12:22.416 --> 12:23.626
Yes.

12:24.793 --> 12:26.128
What's with this cafe?

12:26.128 --> 12:27.379
Is that the makeup...

12:27.546 --> 12:28.839
done by Oumi?

12:29.048 --> 12:31.717
Yamamoto, forget
about that mixer.

12:31.717 --> 12:34.136
At least that girl is pretty.

12:34.136 --> 12:36.430
Thank goodness, it
seems I wasn't recognized.

12:36.847 --> 12:39.058
But why are they here?

12:39.266 --> 12:41.519
But I have to admit, Mitarai.

12:41.519 --> 12:43.938
You're pretty cunning.

12:43.938 --> 12:45.606
An excellent proposal.

12:45.606 --> 12:46.607
Of course.

12:46.815 --> 12:49.735
I can't believe you went
ahead without telling Kitahara.

12:49.735 --> 12:50.528
Twitch!

12:50.528 --> 12:52.738
It's a ticket for four.

12:52.738 --> 12:55.824
So it's likely the other party
is also a group of four, right?

12:56.075 --> 12:59.245
If we go as a group of five,
one person will be left out.

12:59.245 --> 13:02.831
To avoid conflict, removing
that jerk is the best choice.

13:02.831 --> 13:04.750
Beside, his appearance...

13:04.750 --> 13:06.794
He's almost always naked.

13:06.794 --> 13:09.880
With a pervert like that,
picking up girls won't go well.

13:10.214 --> 13:12.299
Leaving him out
is the right move.

13:12.299 --> 13:15.010
I see. So that how it is.

13:15.427 --> 13:18.597
I was hoping to fix this peacefully
so I wouldn't be found out.

13:18.597 --> 13:19.306
But so be it.

13:19.807 --> 13:22.852
Time to show them brimstone!

13:23.310 --> 13:25.187
Shall we get something to drink?

13:25.187 --> 13:27.398
Excuse me, can we order?

13:28.357 --> 13:30.317
Yes, coming right away.

13:31.235 --> 13:32.486
What can I get for you?

13:32.486 --> 13:34.321
One iced coffee.

13:34.321 --> 13:35.531
Understood.

13:36.156 --> 13:37.616
And for you, sir?

13:37.867 --> 13:39.660
I'll also have an iced coffee.

13:39.660 --> 13:41.078
Understood.

13:41.537 --> 13:43.747
Then what about the
"virgin" customer over there?

13:44.164 --> 13:45.791
Isn't that a weird way to ask?

13:46.041 --> 13:47.418
I'm not a virgin.

13:47.418 --> 13:48.627
Sit down, virgin.

13:48.627 --> 13:50.296
Don't bother her, virgin.

13:50.296 --> 13:53.299
It's your fault for
looking like that, virgin.

13:53.465 --> 13:55.134
My apologies.

13:55.968 --> 13:58.220
I couldn't imagine
you not being a virgin.

13:58.220 --> 14:01.056
How is that an apology
when you're being even ruder!?

14:01.473 --> 14:03.309
It's the truth, so
it can't be helped.

14:03.309 --> 14:05.477
I can't imagine you
as anything else, too.

14:05.728 --> 14:07.479
Allow me to rephrase.

14:07.646 --> 14:10.065
What about the "lifelong
virgin" customer?

14:10.065 --> 14:11.817
You can't see the
future, can you?

14:12.151 --> 14:14.486
Sit down, you
esteemed eternal virgin.

14:14.486 --> 14:16.447
It's the truth, so
it can't be helped.

14:16.447 --> 14:18.365
Just look forward
to your next life!

14:18.449 --> 14:21.118
Then I'll have an iced coffee.

14:21.785 --> 14:23.162
Understood.

14:23.495 --> 14:25.581
Let me confirm your order.

14:25.956 --> 14:27.750
CHERRY - VIRGIN Three
cherry cokes, is that right?

14:28.167 --> 14:29.835
That's just for him.

14:29.835 --> 14:31.337
I didn't order that crap.

14:33.172 --> 14:33.964
Huh?

14:33.964 --> 14:36.425
I'm sorry, was that just
a light-hearted joke?

14:36.425 --> 14:37.218
"Light-hearted"?

14:37.218 --> 14:39.845
I've been wounded to the
bottom of my heart though.

14:39.845 --> 14:41.889
Oh, it's just a light joke.

14:42.264 --> 14:43.807
You really like to joke around.

14:44.058 --> 14:45.809
My apologies.

14:46.018 --> 14:49.230
If you don't mind, how
about coffee-flavored cocktail?

14:49.438 --> 14:51.106
Oh, you have alcohol?

14:51.232 --> 14:53.317
Coffee-flavored cocktail?

14:53.359 --> 14:54.777
Not bad.

14:55.027 --> 14:57.029
Let's have some
to help our flirting.

14:57.238 --> 14:58.405
So be it.

14:58.405 --> 14:59.615
I'll have that, too.

14:59.615 --> 15:01.367
Thank you.

15:01.492 --> 15:03.577
Please wait a moment.

15:03.577 --> 15:04.537
Okay.

15:04.537 --> 15:05.788
Counting on you.

15:06.121 --> 15:07.581
I still haven't ordered.

15:09.208 --> 15:12.378
That's weird, where is it?

15:13.087 --> 15:14.380
What are you looking for?

15:14.380 --> 15:15.548
Ah, Cakey.

15:16.006 --> 15:18.008
I can't find the Spirytus.

15:18.008 --> 15:19.134
96% ALCOHOL

15:19.134 --> 15:22.304
Don't say that as if I should
obviously have that on hand.

15:22.555 --> 15:24.306
What did the customers order?

15:24.306 --> 15:26.016
Coffee-flavored cocktail.

15:26.392 --> 15:28.727
Then just use this Kahlua.

15:29.061 --> 15:31.522
How can we get them wasted
with such a weak alcohol?

15:31.522 --> 15:33.816
What are you planning
to do to the customers?

15:34.066 --> 15:37.528
If you pull any funny business,
you'll be thrown out by security.

15:38.571 --> 15:41.490
Can't be helped,
I'll try this then.

15:41.490 --> 15:44.326
Also, don't squat
while wearing a skirt.

15:46.745 --> 15:48.539
Here is your order.

15:48.789 --> 15:50.207
Oh, it's here, it's here.

15:50.207 --> 15:52.334
It doesn't look any
different from coffee.

15:52.334 --> 15:53.586
Can I...

15:53.586 --> 15:55.671
Does coffee-flavored
mean it's Kahlua?

15:55.671 --> 15:58.048
Yes, the base is Kahlua...

15:58.424 --> 16:00.551
with some black
ink to give it color.

16:03.596 --> 16:05.389
Why did you add that?

16:05.389 --> 16:07.766
Kahlua already has dark color.

16:07.766 --> 16:10.019
My apologies, I thought
it would be a good idea.

16:10.019 --> 16:12.354
How did you think
that would be good?

16:12.479 --> 16:14.607
I'm truly sorry.

16:15.441 --> 16:16.317
Can I...

16:16.817 --> 16:18.110
As an apology...

16:18.444 --> 16:20.321
how about I give you my contact?

16:23.824 --> 16:24.867
Can I...

16:25.201 --> 16:28.162
I don't have my phone with me
right now, can I borrow yours?

16:28.454 --> 16:30.206
Let me put my
contact in for you.

16:30.206 --> 16:31.457
Ah, okay.

16:31.457 --> 16:33.709
Send it to us later!

16:33.709 --> 16:35.628
You're dead if you
keep it for yourself.

16:40.090 --> 16:40.925
Ah!

16:40.925 --> 16:41.967
What's wrong?

16:41.967 --> 16:44.470
I may have made a mistake.

16:45.638 --> 16:46.597
It happens.

16:46.597 --> 16:48.557
- It is someone else's phone, after all.
- Can I...

16:48.557 --> 16:50.518
It can't be helped.

16:50.518 --> 16:52.311
Did you type the wrong ID?

16:52.686 --> 16:54.647
No, my hand slipped...

16:54.897 --> 16:57.107
and I mistakenly sent a
message to this person.

16:57.566 --> 16:59.735
RIE OOHASHI Hitting
on girls at the Cakie Cafe.

17:00.236 --> 17:01.820
Wait, what does that mean?

17:02.780 --> 17:04.156
I'm on my way.

17:05.866 --> 17:08.577
Hands don't slip
like that, do they?

17:08.577 --> 17:11.121
Sorry, I'm not
good with machines.

17:11.288 --> 17:13.541
You don't have
to worry about it.

17:13.541 --> 17:16.877
It's his fault for flirting
despite having someone.

17:16.877 --> 17:19.129
Don't let it slip that
I'm having someone.

17:27.763 --> 17:29.348
It's dangerous,
please come this way.

17:29.348 --> 17:30.057
Yes.

17:30.349 --> 17:32.768
Don't just casually put your
arm around her shoulder!

17:32.768 --> 17:34.478
Oh, my apologies.

17:38.691 --> 17:39.608
Actually...

17:40.109 --> 17:41.777
if you don't mind...

17:43.445 --> 17:45.656
there's someone
I'd like you to meet.

17:45.948 --> 17:47.157
Why?

17:48.951 --> 17:50.870
Is that a no?

17:52.204 --> 17:53.664
Is it your parents?

17:54.707 --> 17:56.292
I think it's a bit too soon.

17:56.542 --> 17:57.960
But for your sake...

17:58.544 --> 17:59.420
let's meet them.

18:06.927 --> 18:07.595
Heh?

18:08.888 --> 18:13.017
That man touched me
and wouldn't let me go.

18:13.017 --> 18:14.727
Thanks for reporting him.

18:14.810 --> 18:16.270
Now, come here.

18:16.270 --> 18:19.148
Let me go, it's a
misunderstanding.

18:19.440 --> 18:21.567
No, I saw everything.

18:21.567 --> 18:22.985
There's no mistaking it.

18:23.152 --> 18:24.195
He's a molester.

18:24.612 --> 18:27.364
If I'm a molester,
then so is he!

18:27.364 --> 18:28.199
What?

18:29.950 --> 18:32.328
While you're at it,
arrest that person too.

18:32.328 --> 18:33.245
While they're at it?

18:33.704 --> 18:35.247
Hey! Let me go!

18:35.247 --> 18:36.916
- Ow ow!
- I'm innocent!

18:36.916 --> 18:38.375
It's a misunderstanding!

18:38.375 --> 18:40.419
And so, evil has
been vanquished.

18:41.170 --> 18:44.131
Now, it's almost 2 P.M.

18:44.131 --> 18:45.466
Hey, Iori.

18:46.091 --> 18:49.345
I told you not to
cause any trouble.

18:50.429 --> 18:55.226
CAKIE CAFE

18:57.561 --> 18:59.688
That was you!? You bastard!

18:59.688 --> 19:01.815
How dare you take
advantage of my honesty!?

19:01.815 --> 19:02.942
Take responsibility!

19:02.942 --> 19:04.235
Shut up!

19:04.235 --> 19:07.947
OUMI WOMEN'S COLLEGE

19:11.700 --> 19:13.202
Let's stop, it's useless.

19:13.202 --> 19:14.370
That's right.

19:14.370 --> 19:16.247
There's no point in doing this.

19:16.497 --> 19:18.415
NO ENTRY So,
wanna go for a drink?

19:18.666 --> 19:21.168
It looks like we
can't get back in.

19:21.627 --> 19:24.171
Even if we could get back in,

19:24.505 --> 19:27.341
I don't even want to go
when they're all like that.

19:27.341 --> 19:28.467
That's right.

19:29.718 --> 19:30.427
Huh?

19:30.427 --> 19:31.387
What's that?

19:31.887 --> 19:34.014
IZU NO KO - LIVE STREAM
Isn't that a TV station van?

19:34.014 --> 19:36.517
Are they here to cover
the school festival?

19:36.517 --> 19:39.019
I guess the premium
tickets weren't just for show.

19:40.604 --> 19:41.981
You can check your phone.

19:42.147 --> 19:42.982
Let me see.

19:43.357 --> 19:47.069
This is a unique cafe that's
best known for its thick makeup.

19:47.444 --> 19:49.697
Unfortunately, we
arrived a little late.

19:49.697 --> 19:52.491
The cafe has entered
its second phase.

19:52.741 --> 19:53.784
Second phase?

19:53.784 --> 19:55.077
What's that?

19:55.369 --> 19:57.746
In the second phase,
they'll remove their makeup...

19:57.746 --> 20:01.417
allowing customers to enjoy
the huge difference from the first.

20:01.417 --> 20:02.334
Huh?

20:02.501 --> 20:04.336
Welcome to the Cakie Cafe.

20:04.336 --> 20:07.047
We will now be entering
the second phase.

20:07.047 --> 20:09.258
We look forward to your visit.

20:09.466 --> 20:10.926
Your visit...

20:11.135 --> 20:12.136
Visit...

20:12.720 --> 20:14.597
Apparently, that's what it is.

20:14.597 --> 20:16.640
Remove the makeup
for the second phase?

20:16.640 --> 20:19.268
Are all the girls in
there that pretty?

20:19.268 --> 20:21.437
If only we had known sooner.

20:21.979 --> 20:24.190
OUMI WOMEN'S COLLEGE
FESTIVAL But we're banned from entering.

20:24.190 --> 20:25.608
OUMI WOMEN'S COLLEGE
FESTIVAL And we have no tickets left.

20:25.608 --> 20:27.151
I guess it can't be helped.

20:27.151 --> 20:28.152
Yeah.

20:28.736 --> 20:29.987
What a shame.

20:30.237 --> 20:32.531
The only thing we can do now...

20:35.618 --> 20:37.328
We'll lick your boots.

20:37.328 --> 20:39.038
No, that'd be a problem.

20:39.288 --> 20:41.248
We swear not to
cause any trouble!

20:41.248 --> 20:43.500
- We'll massage your shoulders!
- We'll buy you food!

20:43.500 --> 20:46.086
If this works out, I'll
introduce you to their friends.

20:46.086 --> 20:48.631
I'm telling you, that's
not the problem.

20:48.964 --> 20:50.007
Then we'll do that.

20:50.007 --> 20:50.966
We'll all strip.

20:50.966 --> 20:52.218
And dance.

20:52.218 --> 20:53.552
Dance like a butterfly.

20:53.761 --> 20:55.221
I told you...

20:55.221 --> 20:57.097
Alright, let's do this, guys!

21:02.186 --> 21:03.854
We got chased
out pretty brutally.

21:03.854 --> 21:06.357
They were super pissed.

21:06.357 --> 21:08.859
I guess our passion
didn't get through to them.

21:08.859 --> 21:10.319
What a pity.

21:10.528 --> 21:13.697
But we've done
everything we could.

21:14.198 --> 21:16.700
We desperately begged
them with all our hearts.

21:17.243 --> 21:19.161
If they still won't let us,

21:19.161 --> 21:20.704
then let's give up.

21:21.497 --> 21:22.498
Yeah.

21:22.915 --> 21:24.875
Let's give up on
them letting us in.

21:24.875 --> 21:25.459
OUMI WOMEN'S COLLEGE NO ENTRY

21:27.586 --> 21:29.588
We're breaking in.

21:29.588 --> 21:30.798
Yeah!

21:41.517 --> 21:43.060
Wanna talk to you,
wanna talk to you

21:43.060 --> 21:44.937
First I gotta know all
about you, isn't that right?

21:44.937 --> 21:46.897
Ending it off at round
one reeks of boredom

21:46.897 --> 21:48.649
Rounds two, three,
and four is the plan

21:48.649 --> 21:50.359
As the night gets deeper,
true thoughts escape

21:50.359 --> 21:52.278
Let us go on and on
and dive down late

21:52.278 --> 21:55.281
Your history, your scenery, for
me will your pages get slippery

21:55.281 --> 21:57.324
Hey, show me even more

21:57.324 --> 21:59.076
This is my track and
you are the featured guest

21:59.076 --> 22:00.661
We'll forget by the
time when the dawn hits

22:00.661 --> 22:02.121
Being incomplete is perfection

22:02.121 --> 22:04.373
Hey, show me even more

22:04.373 --> 22:05.958
My mouth keeps slipping,
my mouth keeps slipping

22:05.958 --> 22:07.585
Complaint whether
we sober upward

22:07.585 --> 22:09.628
For now, let's ride
high on this feeling

22:10.004 --> 22:16.051
Let's live this moment with all we
can without leaving a single regret,

22:16.552 --> 22:18.262
We are gonna do it,
we go past the limit now

22:18.262 --> 22:19.889
Not just the whole night,
party till the sun is out

22:19.889 --> 22:22.057
Let's fly high

22:22.057 --> 22:22.641
(Let's fly high)

22:22.641 --> 22:24.643
So first, you just strip it down

22:24.643 --> 22:26.937
An exposed and
feral kind of bond

22:26.937 --> 22:30.566
It's the way of life's cycle,
let us go way beyond

22:30.566 --> 22:32.193
The very moment that
we met I drop my shy act

22:32.193 --> 22:33.944
I wanna bare it all and
say what I need to say

22:33.944 --> 22:35.946
Do it now...

22:36.739 --> 22:41.035
This is the magic spell that breaks
down each and every single wall

22:41.035 --> 22:44.496
And once you get used to
it, you won't feel a thing at all

22:44.496 --> 22:45.998
Being without clothes
is a mystery I live in

22:45.998 --> 22:47.750
The drinking and chatting
is flowing more freely

22:47.750 --> 22:50.127
Try it now...

22:50.544 --> 22:54.048
And right before you
realize what's going on

22:54.048 --> 22:58.260
Your heart will catch
right up and finally be free

23:05.059 --> 23:06.602
Can I take your order?

23:06.602 --> 23:07.937
Thank you for your patronage.

23:07.937 --> 23:08.938
Can I...

23:10.272 --> 23:11.440
order?

23:16.195 --> 23:19.156
NEXT WEEK'S PREVIEW
Now, next week on Grand Blue.

23:19.865 --> 23:23.536
This is Iori. The hot days continue,
is everyone avoiding heatstroke?

23:23.536 --> 23:25.996
The idiots and I went to
the women's college festival.

23:25.996 --> 23:28.082
However, we were kicked out.

23:28.207 --> 23:30.751
But with our burning
desire, we won't give up.

23:31.210 --> 23:34.171
Next time, "The Idiots
and the Break-in Plan."

23:34.171 --> 23:35.548
"Kouhei Goes to the Concert."

23:35.548 --> 23:37.591
"Sakurako-sama Appears."

23:37.967 --> 23:40.177
See you again next week.

23:40.594 --> 23:42.680
Rock-paper-strippers!

23:44.932 --> 23:49.937
NEXT TIME AT THE
WOMEN'S COLLEGE AGAIN
